  "details": "So we all know there is a Verified 18+ tag for people over 18 if they verify their age, but if a minor 13-17 verifies their age, they don’t get a tag. And VRChat had an age verified tag for players 13-17 but that made people confused. So they removed it. But why not add a verified 13-17 tag so people aren’t confused? And when someone turns 18, that tag turns into a verified 18+ tag. This helps people better know if someone is being honest about their age.",
